		(uuid "91de9e26-11e0-4c64-9d38-2f091a2491a7")
	)
	(text "This trace will need to be impedance controlled to 50 Ohms.\nUsing GCPW, this requires a 1 mm trace and 0.2 mm gap. This gets us down\nto 55.7 Ohms, resulting in 0.556 dB/inch loss at 900 MHz.\nClose enough for this ~0.1 inch line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 183.134 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "93a94190-b851-43cc-b503-c1f1b14b1379")
	)
	(text "I am pulling up the gps on/off and reset pins.\nI think this is correct if I'm reading the datasheet correctly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37.084 257.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9998ac53-9203-455c-a1d1-468387a1d03e")
	)
	(text "Charging module.\nProgrammed with 2.0kOhm resistor for ~500mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 54.356 19.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a1722073-e93d-459e-8f5f-86c2318de026")
	)
	(text "To make use of the MCU's extra IO pins, I've added 5 sets of external\npins that can be connected to pull the IO pin low.\nI don't know yet what this may be used for, but I plan to possibly\nadd an interface for users to send text directly on the device.\nMy thinking is that 5 buttons would be enough for 4 direction\nnavigation and a select button."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 69.596 178.054 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bcafc0e5-65b0-4d59-ac2e-3356553e8a46")
	)
	(text "Any ESP32 with Bluetooth capabilities would be acceptable,\nbut I decided on the ESP32 S3 N16R8 for its supperior flash\nmemory and SRAM, and because I already own a few dev boards.\nThe periferal connections were decided (mostly) arbitrarily or\nbased on firmware defaults."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 250.698 27.686 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cf60c844-3266-4b55-ac01-fd275dd62a03")
	)
	(text "Charging status LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 52.324 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d88d1163-a029-40b0-8655-8f1255e84de4")
	)
	(text "Decided on 3.7V, 1500mAh LiPo battery due to\nsmall size and affordability.\nUses JST PH2.0mm connector.\nBe sure that pin 2 goes to B+ and pin 2 is B- and\nwrite it on silk screen."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.036 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e0c2d577-93e7-4c4c-9c41-f7a68b648299")
	)
	(text "IO0: 1 for flash boot, 0 for USB-boot"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.69 73.152 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ee004b56-fe20-489a-afac-c3d01f1f7ea5")
	)
	(text "10 uH inductor for the active antenna VCC injection.\nFrom datasheet"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.842 235.204 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f64e24b6-4f3c-4029-a620-42ad73595bad")
	)
